<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2573" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">anguīnus</span></b> , a, um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>pertaining to the serpent</i>, <i>snaky</i>: cervix, Pac. ap. <i><span class="en">Cic. Div. 2,
				64</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">capillus Eumenidum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					64, 193</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pellis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 73</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cucumis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 2, 25</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adeps,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					30, 5, 12, § 37</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vernatio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					30, 3, 8, § 24</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					30, 3, 8, § 23 al.</span></i>
			—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">anguīnum</span></b> , i, n. (sc.
			ovum), <i>a snake's egg</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 29, 3,
				12, § 52</span></i>.</div>
